	2.	Birth is a fight you don’t remember--only its grip. (1/4)
	3.	Fear teaches the hand before the head. (2)
	4.	Names bruise; work heals. (3)
	5.	Grip before twist. Test before trust. (4/5)
	6.	Every loop is a door--check the hinge. (5)
