	18.	Quiet faults shout on busy nights--listen early. (Anom: silent bugs)
	19.	Green reeds can hide a red river. (Anom: dashboards lie under noise)
	20.	Saving and saving may hide a leak. (Anom: retries mask loss)
	21.	Skip the second look, lose the hunt. (Anom: review skipped)
