E) EFP APPENDIX (drop-in; auditable)
# Local Essence Extraction (privacy+DP)
FUNCTION ExtractEssence(t0,t1,k_min=7,epsilon=1.0):
  records = SELECT moments WHERE ts∈[t0,t1]
  patterns = map_to_canonical(records)                        # "handover.misaligned → clarify-first"
  essence = []
  FOR p IN patterns:
    IF p.count ≥ k_min:
      essence.append({pattern:p.key, count:Laplace(p.count,ε), mttr_days:Median(p.mttr)})
  bundle = {institution_id, period:{from:t0,to:t1}, k_min, epsilon, items:sort(essence), nonce:rand128()}
  canonical = RFC8785(bundle); hash=SHA256(canonical); sig=Ed25519.sign(hash, PRIVKEY)
  RETURN {bundle, hash, sig}

# Handshake (give-to-get; mTLS/WireGuard)
POST /v1/essence/offer   → {institution_id, period, contribution_score, bundle_hash, signature}
POST /v1/essence/bundle  → {exchange_token, bundle, hash, signature}  # policy gates: k_min, ε, window≥14d
GET  /v1/counter-mirror?period=...  → signed national aggregates (relevance-filtered, DP enforced)

Governance: annual key rotation; revocation list; Merkle-root audits; HSM/TPM storage. Threats: re-ID, linkage, poisoning, MITM, key-compromise (mitigations embedded).
Success Metrics: reuse_rate • MTTRΔ • pattern_survival • participation.

