Reply template (YAML). Use one block per idea, or one big block covering all six:
role: "<your role>"
idea: "<# and short name>"
stance: "<green | amber | red>"
summary: "<3–4 sentences, plain words>"
benefits:
  - "<bullet>"
  - "<bullet>"
risks:
