APEX--COUNCIL PLANBOARD (read-only)

Ground rules (reaffirmed)
•	Discussion only. No code, no system changes.
•	Zurich anchor for timestamps & summaries.
•	Privacy floors stay adaptive; rollback integrity assumed; Swiss DPA + AML awareness baked in.
