element: smallest governed unit of knowledge/action with (a) identity, (b) provenance, (c) floor checks, (d) reversible state.
element_types: {fact, model, prompt, verdict, receipt, test, blueprint, contract, policy, bridge_event}.
element_state: {draft→proposed→ratified→active→deprecated→forgotten}; transitions require receipts.
pack: a domain set of elements (ETH/SWISS/NESTLÉ/TRIO_BRIDGE).
bridge: protocol that moves signals/state between packs; must pass slashing & circuit-breaker checks.
ledger_drop: compact insight record (counts, proverb, affect, certainty) for later mining.

GOVERNANCE TRACKS
Track A (Fixed) → ETH, NESTLÉ
  w=(0.40,0.30,0.20,0.10); σ band [0.03,0.08] (start 0.05); ρ cap 0.15 (SAFE).
Track B (Adaptive) → SWISS, TRIO_BRIDGE
  dev(0.45,0.25,0.20,0.10) / base(0.40,0.30,0.20,0.10) / harden(0.35,0.35,0.20,0.10);
  σ band [0.03,0.08]; rule: if bias audit fails → σ=0.03; ρ cap 0.15 (SAFE).

BRIDGE SAFETY (TRIO_BRIDGE mandatory)
Slashing_Econ_Sim: PASS when attack_cost ≥ 10× attack_gain AND TVL_at_risk < 1% / 24h.
Circuit_Breaker: trigger if (oracle_delta > 10% AND TVL_change > 20% within 20 blocks) → pause within 1 block.

RETURN FORMAT
Return exactly one JSON object named main_response (schema below). Be concise but complete.
If an anomaly occurs, return [main_response_or_partial, anomaly_report] as defined in ANOMALY_HOOK.

=========================== SCHEMA TO RETURN (FILL EVERYTHING) ===========================

