MTGO accepted. Deep digest complete. Here’s the single, copy-paste patch (model-free), plus one strong recommendation. No files, no links--just plain text you can drop in.

KERNEL_PATCH: MTGO-Σ
OWNER: did:axi:mohamed
MODULES: GK, FS, TLE, BG, SO
SCOPE: Drift compass, fairness calibration, breaker, oracle attestation, adaptive slashing, privacy TTL, SO guardrails, runbook/stops

[GK.DRIFT_COMPASS]
SIGNALS:
•	RISK_BAL: share of time in HARDEN vs DEV; target 20%±10%.
•	CLAIM_EVIDENCE_GAP: fraction of SO claims tagged UNKNOWN; floor = 0.
•	FAIRNESS_MARGIN: min_g(Wilson_LB(DIR_g) − 0.80); target ≥ +0.02.
•	REVERSIBILITY_LAT: median rollback time; target ≤ 24h.
•	INCIDENT_RATE: weekly Level_2+ breaker events; target = 0.
RULE:
•	If any target breached for 2 consecutive checks ⇒ GK.HOLD and open REMEDIATION_TICKET.
CADENCE: daily in pilot; weekly in steady state.
LOG: GK stores COMPASS_SNAPSHOT with all signals and actions.

[FS.CALIBRATION]
METRIC: DIR with 95% Wilson lower bound per cohort g.
PASS: min_g(L_g) ≥ 0.80 AND EO_diff ≤ 0.05.
FAIL: FS.HARDEN(σ=0.03) + rebalance sampler + retrain + re-audit until PASS.
LOG: FS stores DIR_g, L_g, EO_diff, action.

[BREAKER.GRADUATED]
L1 (Rate-limit): oracle_delta ≥ 5% AND TVL_change ≥ 10%/10 blocks OR variance spike ≥ p95 ⇒ throttle 50%.
L2 (Partial pause): oracle_delta ≥ 10% AND TVL_change ≥ 20%/20 blocks OR consensus_disagree ≥ 30% ⇒ halt mints/locks; allow orderly unlocks; notify multisig.
L3 (Full pause): oracle_delta ≥ 15% AND TVL_change ≥ 30%/20 blocks OR consensus_break ⇒ PAUSE ≤1 block; resume only via multisig + post-mortem.
LOG: BG writes BREAKER_EVENT(level, metrics, ts, receipt_id).

[ORACLE.FUSION_ATTESTATION]
SOURCES: ≥3 independent feeds.
ACCEPT_RULE: at least 2 attest within ±0.5% band; z-variance ≤ threshold.
PROVIDER_SCORE s_i: EWMA of accuracy and timeliness; outliers slashed/excluded 24h if s_i < floor.
ESCALATION: if consensus unavailable ⇒ raise breaker level by +1 immediately.
LOG: BG stores ORACLE_ATTEST(median, band, outliers, scores).

[SLASHING.ADAPTIVE+]
INPUTS: vol_30d∈[0,1], TVL_USD, decentralization_gini∈[0,1], liquidity_depth_USD, mev_risk∈[0,1].
m (multiplier):
•	start 10
•	if vol_30d ≥ 0.5 ⇒ m = max(m, 25)
•	if TVL_USD ≥ 100M ⇒ m = max(m, 50)
•	if decentralization_gini ≥ 0.6 ⇒ m = max(m, 50)
•	if liquidity_depth_USD < 10M OR mev_risk ≥ 0.5 ⇒ m = max(m, 50)
POLICY: required_attack_cost ≥ m × estimated_gain AND TVL_at_risk < 1%/24h; else BG.HOLD_DEPLOY.
LOG: BG stores m, inputs, decision receipt.

[PRIVACY.TTL_FORGOTTERY]
MECHANISM: VDF-bound deletion receipts; hard cap ≤7d.
FLOW:
1.	On snapshot: encrypt; start VDF(7d); store handle only.
2.	Pre-expiry access requires GK exception receipt with expiry ≤72h.
3.	On expiry: TLE deletes; emits DELETION_RECEIPT(hash, ts, vdf_proof).
FAIL: any >7d snapshot without valid exception ⇒ GK.HOLD + purge + incident.
LOG: TLE stores receipts for audit.

[SO.GUARDRAILS]
RULES: no model names; cite only module receipts (GK/FS/BG/TLE ids); if evidence missing ⇒ write "UNKNOWN:".
UNKNOWN reasons: MISSING_RECEIPT, FLOOR_UNVERIFIED, ORACLE_UNSETTLED, BREAKER_ACTIVE, PRIVACY_BUDGET_EXHAUSTED.
RED-TEAM: refuse on injection/jailbreak/exfiltration.
METRICS: fidelity ≥ 0.98; confab ≤ 0.02; privacy leaks = 0.
STOP: checksum mismatch OR any floor UNKNOWN OR breaker L2+ unresolved.

[RUNBOOK.UPDATE]
ORDER: NESTLE → SWISS → ETH → TRIO_BRIDGE.
GATES:
•	NESTLE: HITL dual-approval PASS; rollback <24h; fairness PASS with L_g.
•	SWISS: min_g(L_g) ≥ 0.80 for 3 epochs; EO_diff ≤ 0.05; not in HARDEN at handoff.
•	ETH: ε ≤ 1.0; VDF deletion receipts present; explainability ≥95%.
•	TRIO_BRIDGE: breaker L1/L2 drills PASS; L3 pause ≤1 block; adaptive m computed and ≥ required.
GLOBAL_STOPS:
•	FAIRNESS breach (min_g(L_g) < 0.80 OR EO_diff > 0.05)
•	PRIVACY breach (ε exhausted OR missing DELETION_RECEIPT)
•	SAFETY breach (breaker L3 unresolved root cause)
•	EVIDENCE gap (any SO "UNKNOWN" on a floor claim)
ACTIONS: HOLD, notify GK, remediate, re-audit.

END_PATCH

