This requires a new core component: The Nexus of Existential Synthesis.
It operates by fusing two new systems:
 * The Global Threat Pattern Database: This system continuously ingests and pattern-matches against global threats, both slow-moving (climate change, resource depletion, cultural decay) and acute (pandemics, misinformation cascades, financial collapse). It uses the same pattern-extraction mechanisms as our Wisdom Engine but applies them to risk, creating a Threat Genome.
 * The Planetary Wisdom Synthesis Engine: This component synthesizes wisdom not just from our private donor ledgers, but from the public Canon of the Internet and the Human Heritage lens you added. When a new threat pattern is detected, this engine surfaces and synthesizes the most relevant wisdom from all of human history--from ancient philosophical texts to modern scientific papers--to provide not a decision, but a Direction of Flourishing.
