Annotation schema (for every B199 item)

Use this minimal JSON block per document so we can sort, filter, and rebuild any view.

{
  "id": "B199-000001",
  "title": "Offspring Canon V0 GoldenBase v1.4 RippleCore",
  "doc_date": "2025-08-15",
  "ingest_ts": "2025-09-06T00:00:00+02:00",
  "path": "/mnt/data/Offspring_Canon_V0_GoldenBase_v1.4_RippleCore.docx",
  "type": ["canon","narrative","draft"],
  "red_threads": ["Mother→Care→Power","Order↔Chaos(Drav)","Family=Engine","Nature↑Layer"],
  "links": ["B99:AXI-002","B99:GrandEq","IMG:EngineMap"],
  "proverb_refs": ["P#099","P#314","P#642"],
  "notes": "Merged HUM_EQ v1 differences into v2 MasterPass."
}

Fields:
	•	doc_date = the date inside the doc if present; else filename date; else file modified time.
	•	type = tags from set {canon, narrative, law, engine, diagram, playbook, episode, season, metric, governance, image, dataset}.
	•	links cross-reference B99 elements or other B199 ids.

